        /opt/rolling/rolling_ma_service/rolling_ma


1.  SCOPE AND BACKGROUND

    rolling_ma is the ModemManager FCC-unlock helper of this project.  It is
    distributed as a prebuilt x86-64 ELF executable: the translation units it
    was built from (rolling_ma_main.c, rolling_ma_at.c, sha256.c, dmidecode.c)
    are not published in this repository, and this directory carries no
    CMakeLists.txt, so nothing here is compiled from source.

    rolling_ma is therefore NOT covered by the GNU Lesser General Public
    License version 2.1 that applies to the published source code of this
    project (see the LICENSE file in the top-level directory, SECTION A), and
    it cannot be rebuilt from the published sources -- it does not meet the
    Debian Free Software Guidelines requirement that the preferred form for
    modification be available.

    Redistribution in binary form is granted by the copyright holder under
    this license.  The repository-level LICENSE file states the same grant in
    its SECTION B; this file is the self-contained copy that travels with the
    binary.


